classDiagram
  direction TB
  accTitle: Simplified DOT domain model
  accDescr: Dot references Skills, declares Contracts, and contains Anchors and Runtime alternatives. An Anchor selects a Contract operation. Each Runtime targets a Platform and contains Deployments. A Deployment contains one manifest and its logical services. Composition instances and wires live outside this Java aggregate.

  class Dot {
    id
    name
    version
  }
  class Skill {
    name
  }
  class Contract {
    standard
    payload
  }
  class Anchor {
    role
    contract
  }
  class Runtime
  class Platform {
    engine
  }
  class Deployment {
    id
  }
  class DeploymentManifest {
    <<abstract>>
    type
  }
  class DeploymentService {
    id
  }

  Dot --> Skill : references
  Dot --> Contract : declares
  Dot *-- Anchor : anchors
  Dot *-- Runtime : runtimes
  Anchor ..> Contract : selects operation
  Runtime *-- Platform : target
  Runtime *-- Deployment : alternatives
  Deployment *-- DeploymentManifest : manifest
  Deployment *-- DeploymentService : services
